  "title": "17 March 1968: Pattie Harrison celebrates her 24th birthday in India",
  "date": "1968-03-17",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a>’s wife <a href=\"/people/pattie-boyd/\">Pattie</a> celebrated her 24th birthday on this day in Rishikesh, India. <span id=\"more-11976\"></span></p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1968-photos/beatles_india_680317_04/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-11981\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"11981\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1968-photos/beatles_india_680317_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"465,316\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George and Pattie Harrison on her 24th birthday, India, 17 March 1968\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_04.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_04.jpg\" alt=\"George and Pattie Harrison on her 24th birthday, India, 17 March 1968\" title=\"George and Pattie Harrison on her 24th birthday, India, 17 March 1968\" width=\"465\" height=\"316\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-11981\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_04.jpg 465w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_04-200x136.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 465px) 100vw, 465px\"></a></p><p>A number of photographs from this day were published in April 1968 in an edition of British music magazine Disc And Music Echo. They included Pattie being given her birthday cake, The Beatles with local entertainer Shah Jahan and flautist friend Paul Horn, George Harrison checking a yogi’s pulse, and Paul McCartney playing a tamboura.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/03/17/pattie-harrison-celebrates-24th-birthday-india/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galle