317_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"465,362\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney and Jane Asher in India, 17 March 1968\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/beatles_india_680317_03.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 4 August 2012</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2013: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2013/03/17/blue-plaque-john-lennon-george-harrison-apple-boutique/\">Blue plaque for Lennon and Harrison unveiled at the Apple Boutique building</a></li><li>2009: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2009/03/17/struggling-penny-lane-businesses/\">Struggling Penny Lane businesses ask for help</a></li><li>2009: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2009/03/17/ringo-release-book-beatles-photographs/\">Ringo to release book of Beatles photographs?</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/03/17/album-release-back-in-the-world-paul-mccartney/\">Album release: Back In The World by Paul McCartney</a></li><li>1993: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1993/03/17/paul-mccartney-live-sydney-entertainment-centre-sydney-2/\">Paul McCartney live: Sydney Entertainment Centre, Sydney</a></li><li>1978: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1978/03/17/us-single-release-with-a-little-luck-wings/\">US single release: With A Little Luck by Wings</a></li><li>1977: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1977/03/17/recording-b-side-to-seaside-suzy-and-the-red-stripes-2/\">Recording: B Side To Seaside by Suzy And The Red Stripes</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/03/17/recording-spirits-of-ancient-egypt-wings-5/\">Recording: Spirits Of Ancient Egypt by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/03/17/joe-english-joins-wings/\">Joe English joins